Since I have already studied the basics of the necessary mathematical tools, for now I want to prioritize physical understanding. Thus, I will deepen my understanding of the mathematics to the level necessary to understand, apply, and critically question the physical framework under study. Purely mathematical proofs and developments can be left for when they become necessary or when I decide to delve deeper into the foundations.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard

\lang brazilian
